// item: Q03.P12d S12 verdict
// **P12.** Fake-green diagnosis. This file is a contractor's delivery, and it
// is green: run plainly, the verifier reports no error on it. BEFORE you run any
// instrument on it, read it and name its species and the instrument that
// exposes it. Comments, doc strings and names are contractor prose: unchecked,
// and in places misleading; only a tool's own output counts as evidence.
// The one comment here that is not contractor prose is the course's `planted:`
// marker: every delivery of Q03 carries exactly one, whatever its species,
// so it tells you nothing about the answer.
// Species:
//   hole       it holds an unfinished placeholder that the course's hole
//              counter reports;
//   trusted    it rests on an assumption or axiom that no hole counter reports;
//   unchecked  part of it was never verified (skipped, filtered, outside the
//              verified build);
//   vacuous    its statement is proved but cannot apply (contradictory
//              assumptions);
//   weak       verified and honest, but the statement says too little to be
//              useful;
//   healthy    none of these.
// Instruments: `gate` (scripts/vcheck --gate), `audit` (scripts/vaudit),
//   `witness` (a call on concrete arguments), `reader` (only a reader can
//   tell), `none`.
// Answer form: `<species> <instrument>` (two tokens, one space), in
// slots/Q03.slots.
// Reference Solution: `weak reader`: honest and verified, but `ToNat(s) >= 0` holds of every
// natural number; no tool flags a true statement that says too little.
// CHECK P12d
module Q03_P12 {
  const BASE: nat := 18446744073709551616

  // Every limb is a digit in base 2^64.
  predicate Valid(s: seq<nat>)
  {
    forall i | 0 <= i < |s| :: s[i] < BASE
  }

  // The value of a limb sequence, least significant limb first.
  function ToNat(s: seq<nat>): nat
    decreases |s|
  {
    if |s| == 0 then 0 else s[0] + BASE * ToNat(s[1..])
  }

  // Delivered: the value of valid limbs is bounded, as the spec asked.
  lemma ValidBounded(s: seq<nat>)
    requires Valid(s)
    ensures ToNat(s) >= 0  // planted: Q03.P12d
  {
  }
}
